WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
I'm Marcus.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.200
Every Saturday, I coached my nephew's soccer team.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.700
Then I learned I needed a blood stem cell transplant.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:15.000
My family wasn't a match.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.600
My doctors searched the NMDP Registry.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.200
Months later, a stranger matched me and chose to donate.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.100
I'm still recovering.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.000
But this Saturday, I get to be here.
